      "value": "short update. It seems that _some_ HLS streams do work. Like this official test stream:\nhttps://cph-p2p-msl.akamaized.net/hls/live/2000341/test/master.m3u8\nSo it appears not to be a general issue.\nAlso in one streaming application i was able to change some setting to get it to work:\nFFMPEG2 with hardware encoder = does not work\nFFMPEG2 without hardware encoder = works\nFFMPEG1 with hardware encoder = works\nall using H264 720p 2.5mbps AAC 128kbps\nit seems there is some very specific options that are needed to get a working stream. Even if using the exact same formats. just switching the encoder can help.\nBut i guess it needs some more in detail testing",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
