  "details": "Game freezes for me when i enter a private HLS Stream into video player, and everyone else in the world who changes world or leaves after that or for the person who tries to change video after that.\n\nOnly way to get out is to kill VRChat.\n\nTested with http and https URL.\n\nwas 100% reproducible in the \"Cozy Boat\" Worlds video player.\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_6ebfc3e2-3553-4cd3-9aca-1ee5e84f7811\n\nTested with:\n2 persons with Intel CPU and NVIDIA GPU.\n1 person with AMD CPU and NVIDIA GPU\n\n\nErrors i could find in the log that might point to some issue (when i tried changing to Home world after joining the broken world instance again):\n\nhttps://pastebin.com/5ALnRNWp",
